OL,3,GNEWSADaughter of nuclear test veteran  
OL,4,Ablames his radiation exposure for her  
OL,5,Afertility issues                       
OL,7,FThe daughter of a nuclear test veteran,
OL,8,Fwho has never been able to have        
OL,9,Fchildren, has blamed her health        
OL,10,Fcomplications on her father's exposure 
OL,11,Fto radiation.                          
OL,13,FWhen Barbara Quick was in her twenties 
OL,14,Fshe and her partner at the time faced  
OL,15,Ffertility issues.                      
OL,17,FThe 54-year-old from Ayrshire had      
OL,18,Fvarious tests but was never able to    
OL,19,Fconceive, while her sister also had    
OL,20,Fproblem pregnancies including the      
OL,21,Fdeaths of two babies.                  
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
