OL,3,GNEWSADaughter of nuclear test veteran  
OL,4,Ablames his radiation exposure for her  
OL,5,Afertility issues                       
OL,7,FTheir father served in the RAF Police  
OL,8,Fon Christmas Island, a major sight for 
OL,9,FUK and US nuclear testing in the       
OL,10,FPacific Ocean, in 1958. However, the   
OL,11,FMinistry of Defence (MoD) has for      
OL,12,Fdecades denied it covered up the impact
OL,13,Fof radiation on troops.                
